    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At the table",
     "texto": [
      "**배고파요** = I am hungry.",
      "**맛있어요** = it is tasty (literally, «it has flavour»). **맛없어요** = it is not tasty.",
      "Some dishes you will always hear: **비빔밥** (rice with vegetables), **불고기** (marinated beef), **김밥** (rice and seaweed roll), **라면** (instant noodles) and **떡볶이** (spicy rice cakes)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
